      "body": "Kati Patang Lifestyle Limited (BSE:531126) agreed to acquire Agnetta International Pvt. Ltd. for INR 35 million on March 3, 2026. The consideration consists of common equity of Kati Patang Lifestyle Limited having a value of INR 35 million to be issued for common equity of Agnetta International Pvt. Ltd. As part of consideration, INR 35 million is paid towards common equity of Agnetta International Pvt. Ltd. In a related transaction Kati Patang Lifestyle Limited agreed to acquire remaining 2% stake in Empyrean Spirits Private Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Agnetta International Pvt. Ltd. reported total revenue of INR 60.4 million. As of March 31, 2025, Agnetta International Pvt. Ltd. reported total common equity of INR 26.8 million.\n\nThe transaction is subject to approval ",
